                        </p>
                        <p>Thirteen extant otter species. Coastal, riverine, and lacustrine habitats on every continent except Australia and Antarctica. Most are crepuscular; sea otters are the diurnal exception.</p>
                      </ac:adf-content>
                    </ac:adf-node>
