                      <strong>Field practice</strong>
                      <ul>
                        <li>
                          <strong>Observation</strong>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                          <a href="(planned)">Safety</a>
                        </li>
                      </ul>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                  <p>
                    <strong>Field practice</strong>
                  </p>
                  <h1>Observation</h1>
                  <p>
                    <em>A short protocol for spotting and recording otter activity without disturbing the animals.</em>
                  </p>
                  <ac:adf-extension>
                    <ac:adf-node type="panel">
                      <ac:adf-attribute key="panel-type">note</ac:adf-attribute>
                      <ac:adf-content>
                        <p>
                          <strong>TL;DR</strong>
                        </p>
                        <p>Stay downwind, downstream, and silent. Otters are wary of humans and will abandon a holt that feels exposed. Use a 10× monocular and start from a screened position at dawn or dusk.</p>
                      </ac:adf-content>
                    </ac:adf-node>
                  </ac:adf-extension>
                  <h2>Protocol</h2>
                  <ol>
                    <li>
                      <strong>Choose a screened vantage</strong>
                      <p>Reedbed, hide, or a dense alder thicket — anything that breaks your silhouette and absorbs sound.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <strong>Wait silently</strong>
                      <p>Allow at least 20 minutes for ambient wildlife to forget you are there.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <strong>Record bare-eye, sketch on paper</strong>
                      <p>Phones glow. Sketch in pencil; transcribe later.</p>
                    </li>
                  </ol>
                  <h2>What to record</h2>
                  <ac:task-list>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Time, weather, water height</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Activity (foraging, grooming, transit)</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Direction of travel and last known position</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Any vocalisations</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                  </ac:task-list>
                </ac:layout-cell>
              </ac:layout-section>
              <ac:layout-section ac:type="two_equal">
