                  </ul>
                  <p>
                    <strong>Field practice</strong>
                  </p>
                  <h1>Safety</h1>
                  <p>
                    <em>Brief notes on staying safe around wild otters and the waterbodies they inhabit.</em>
                  </p>
                  <ac:adf-extension>
                    <ac:adf-node type="panel">
                      <ac:adf-attribute key="panel-type">warning</ac:adf-attribute>
                      <ac:adf-content>
                        <p>Otters bite, and giant otters in particular will defend a den aggressively. Never approach a holt. If an animal is on shore between you and the water, retreat — never block its escape route.</p>
                      </ac:adf-content>
                    </ac:adf-node>
                  </ac:adf-extension>
                  <h2>Personal safety</h2>
                  <ac:task-list>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Keep at least 15 metres of distance</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Never feed or attempt to handle</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Carry a whistle for emergency signalling</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                    <ac:task>
                      <ac:task-status>incomplete</ac:task-status>
                      <ac:task-body>
                        <span>Watch the bank for current and slip hazards</span>
                      </ac:task-body>
                    </ac:task>
                  </ac:task-list>
                  <h2>Animal welfare</h2>
                  <p>Disturbance is a measurable stressor. Limit each session to 90 minutes and rotate vantage points across visits so the same family group is not repeatedly observed.</p>
                </ac:layout-cell>
              </ac:layout-section>
