                            <li><ac:structured-macro ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">400</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Red</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro><code>application/json</code> — Malformed input.</li>
                            <li><ac:structured-macro ac:name="status" ac:schema-version="1"><ac:parameter ac:name="title">422</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="colour">Red</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro><code>application/json</code> — Schema validation failed; <code>issues[]</code> contains details.</li>
                          </ul>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </tbody>
                  </table>
                  <h2>Rubric (weighted scoring)</h2>
                  <p>Weighted scoring grid for comparison documents — like <code>rd-compare</code> but with numeric scores, weights, and an automatic totals row. The winning column highlights.</p>
